\ Companion module for module_load_in_flight.1z. Same delegation as reentry_outer.1z, but the
\ borrowing task loads a pair of modules that import each other, so the cycle is entirely its own.

"REENTRY-CYCLE-OUTER-START" print-line

[ [ "./reentry_cycle_a.1z" load drop ] spawn drop ] task-scope

"REENTRY-CYCLE-OUTER-END" print-line
